he previously saved future date\", \"actual\": \"Saved date was Sep 4, 2027. Entering the past date 2020-01-15 and clicking Save closed the dialog with no error; dashboard date became \\\"Jan 15, 2020\\\" and the countdown element disappeared entirely.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Listing detail views cannot be opened; \\\"View Details\\\"/\\\"View Profile\\\" buttons are inert\", \"actual\": \"Clicked venue v1 \\\"View Details\\\" and vendor vn1 \\\"View Profile\\\". In both cases the URL stayed on /venues and /vendors, no dialog/modal was created (0 elements matching dialog/[role=dialog]/[aria-modal]), page text length was unchanged, and no new hinted region appeared in the semantic snapshot. The buttons are plain BUTTON elements not wrapped in links and produce no navigation or detail panel.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marking cl6-1 → state=completed, checklist progress 0%→20% immediately; marking cl6-2 → 40%; unmarking cl6-2 → back to 20%. Dashboard aggregate over saved checklists updated accordingly (cl6 only = 20%; with cl3 also saved = 10% for 1 of 10 tasks). After full page reload, cl6 still shows 20% with cl6-1=completed and the other four not-completed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"cake\\\" character-by-character updated results with no submit action → \\\"Showing 1 of 10 vendors\\\" (Sweet Celebrations Bakery). Filter toggle clicks also updated count/grid immediately. Clearing the search restored \\\"Showing 10 of 10 vendors\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancelled draft persists in editor; form is not reset to last saved values on reopen\", \"actual\": \"Saved values were Alicia/Robert/2027-09-04/52500/95. Edited to \\\"ZZZ Draft\\\"/99999/7 and clicked Cancel — dashboard correctly stayed at \\\"Alicia & Robert\\\", \\\"$52,500\\\", \\\"95\\\". But reopening the editor showed the cancelled draft: partnerOne=ZZZ Draft, budget=99999, guests=7 instead of the saved values.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows couple \\\"Alicia & Robert\\\", formatted date \\\"Sep 4, 2027\\\", budget \\\"$52,500\\\", guests \\\"95\\\", progress \\\"20%\\\", favorites counts (1 saved venues / 2 saved vendors) plus previews (Rosewood Garden Estate, Gourmet Celebrations, Rev. Sarah Mitchell), and saved checklists count \\\"1 saved\\\" with preview \\\"Honeymoon Planning – 1 of 5 completed\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue v1 card: type \\\"Garden\\\", price \\\"Luxury ($$$)\\\", name, location \\\"Napa Valley, CA\\\", rating 4.9, summary description, capacity \\\"Up to 200 guests\\\". Vendor vn1 card: service \\\"Photography\\\", price, name, location \\\"Los Angeles, CA\\\", rating 4.9, summary, specialties (Candid Shots / Drone Photography / Same-Day Edits).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Per-category filtering: planning=[12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before], ceremony=[Ceremony Planning], reception=[Reception Details], attire=[Wedding Attire], honeymoon=[Honeymoon Planning] — all 5 topics covered with >=1 checklist. All 33 tasks across the 6 checklists have a title and a non-empty description (desc lengths 34-79 chars).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined Florist+Budget on vendors → \\\"Showing 1 of 10 vendors\\\", the single result satisfied both criteria. Adding search \\\"photography\\\" → \\\"Showing 0 of 10 vendors\\\" with no-match state \\\"No vendors match your search. / Try adjusting your filters or search terms.\\\" Clearing search 